      "uid": "zhcn:ea9be6e1e1950b09088c9cb3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毕竟真弓快车中途转换跑道挑战短距离路线，\n也难怪众人对她失去兴趣。但她仍鼓起干劲，\n今天一定要让大家想起真弓这个选手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce85916a6ae2c2c5bfd1989204da80749cad8eeeeed56d418b0f7f4dd77740f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
