      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“四格漫画博客”的点击量原本顺利地成长，\n最近却突然大幅减少，差异之剧烈\n甚至令人感到诡异。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd47d181094ea8eae1bb6b235b38113ff58511173a7d38c5ce01a8e8b939eb04",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
