      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就连真弓快车本身也状况不佳──\n原因果然还是出在春天吗？\n比赛就在这令人不安的气氛中开始了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a636d59e6273ecb13991b15c51a2455073c1a8caea527e2034923b36ef4986f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
