      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天观众们都很期待真弓快车的表现！\n曾经惨遭众人无视的“高松宫纪念”仿佛一场梦。\n不仅如此──",
      "source_fingerprint": "92e45f36c6afcd4393df93208dc9f76512ef038f2d34ef7089b2b233bdeb67d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
