      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "三人皆宣称自己将会是今日冠军。加入\n“好朋友”的行列令真弓快车十分开心，\n并出声邀请两人与自己一同创造传说！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b387b6a7130c6cfb139bfd3e11a70842a8ca7e73a4faca3fa25be17fafa3a2d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
