    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ffc7bfd78aa337a99248f95",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加占领了观众的目光。\n她那不畏一切坚持到底的跑法令人们不禁\n心生期待，就连大和赤骥也大受震撼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47d73732000b44b5476d65c64229d1155ae5736b0c10822e5fce851be26abfba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
